{"kind":"html","caption":"用回溯法逐行放置皇后，每一行只选择一个不会与已有皇后同列、同主对角线或同副对角线的位置。遇到无可选位置时撤销最近一次选择并继续尝试，放满 4 行就记录一个解。示例 n = 4 最终得到两种互为镜像的方案。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>N 皇后回溯过程</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\nmain{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}\nh1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}\n.lead{margin:0 0 8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px}\n.panel{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}\n.panel-title{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.board{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,38px);gap:4px;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.cell{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d2d;color:#8d8d8d;transition:background .25s,border-color .25s,color .25s}\n.cell.light{background:#252526}\n.cell .piece{font-size:14px;line-height:1}\n.cell .coord{margin-top:2px;font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d}\n.cell.queen,.cell.trying{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.cell.queen .coord,.cell.trying .coord{color:#d4d4d4}\n.cell.conflict{background:#4a2f2f;border-color:#d16969;color:#ffd7d7}\n.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px 8px;margin-top:6px;font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d}\n.dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;display:inline-block;vertical-align:-1px;margin-right:4px}\n.status{padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;line-height:1.45;margin-top:6px}\n.sets{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;margin-top:8px}\n.set-row{padding:6px 8px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d2d}\n.set-row .name{display:block;margin-bottom:4px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}\n.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;min-height:18px}\n.chip{padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;background:#0e639c;color:#fff;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:10px}\n.empty{color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}\n.progress{margin-top:8px;height:3px;background:#3c3c3c;border-radius:2px;overflow:hidden}\n.bar{height:100%;background:#3794ff;transition:width .3s}\n.step-label{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:4px;color:#8d8d8d;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:10px}\n.solution-list{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:6px}\n.solution{padding:6px 8px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d2d;font-size:10px}\n.solution.active{border-color:#3794ff;background:#0e639c}\n.solution-title{margin-bottom:4px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}\n.rows{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:1.4}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>n = 4：逐行试放与回溯</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\">每放皇后占用列与对角线；冲突跳过，无路则撤销上一行。</p>\n<div class=\"panel\">\n<div class=\"panel-title\">搜索棋盘</div>\n<div id=\"board\" class=\"board\" aria-label=\"四皇后棋盘\"></div>\n<div class=\"legend\"><span><i class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff\"></i>当前/皇后</span><span><i class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#4a2f2f;border-color:#d16969\"></i>冲突</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel\">\n<div class=\"panel-title\">回溯状态</div>\n<div id=\"status\" class=\"status\"></div>\n<div class=\"sets\">\n<div class=\"set-row\"><span class=\"name\">已占用列 col</span><div id=\"cols\" class=\"chips\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"set-row\"><span class=\"name\">主对角线 row − col</span><div id=\"diag1\" class=\"chips\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"set-row\"><span class=\"name\">副对角线 row + col</span><div id=\"diag2\" class=\"chips\"></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\"><div id=\"bar\" class=\"bar\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"step-label\"><span id=\"step\"></span><span>每次一行</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel\">\n<div class=\"panel-title\">完整方案</div>\n<div class=\"solution-list\">\n<div id=\"sol1\" class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-title\">方案 1</div><div class=\"rows\">.Q..<br>...Q<br>Q...<br>..Q.</div></div>\n<div id=\"sol2\" class=\"solution\"><div class=\"solution-title\">方案 2</div><div class=\"rows\">..Q.<br>Q...<br>...Q<br>.Q..</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst frames=[\n{q:[],tryCell:[0,0],bad:false,msg:'从第 <b>0</b> 行开始，尝试第 <b>0</b> 列。',found:0},\n{q:[[0,0]],tryCell:[1,0],bad:true,msg:'第 1 行第 0 列与已有皇后<b>同列</b>，跳过。',found:0},\n{q:[[0,0],[1,2]],tryCell:[2,0],bad:true,msg:'继续深入后，第 2 行的候选位置均受攻击，这条分支将失败。',found:0},\n{q:[[0,0],[1,2]],tryCell:null,bad:false,msg:'当前行无合法位置：<b>撤销</b>第 1 行选择，返回上一层继续枚举。',found:0},\n{q:[[0,1]],tryCell:[1,3],bad:false,msg:'第 0 行改选第 1 列；第 1 行第 3 列通过三项冲突检查。',found:0},\n{q:[[0,1],[1,3],[2,0]],tryCell:[3,2],bad:false,msg:'前三行都合法，第 3 行只剩第 2 列可选。',found:0},\n{q:[[0,1],[1,3],[2,0],[3,2]],tryCell:null,bad:false,msg:'放满 4 行，记录<b>方案 1</b>，随后继续回溯寻找其他答案。',found:1},\n{q:[[0,2],[1,0],[2,3],[3,1]],tryCell:null,bad:false,msg:'另一条分支也放满 4 行，记录互为镜像的<b>方案 2</b>。',found:2},\n{q:[],tryCell:null,bad:false,msg:'所有分支枚举完成，共得到 <b>2</b> 个不同方案。动画即将重新开始。',found:2}\n];\nconst board=document.getElementById('board');\nfor(let r=0;r<4;r++){for(let c=0;c<4;c++){const cell=document.createElement('div');cell.className='cell '+((r+c)%2?'light':'');cell.dataset.r=r;cell.dataset.c=c;cell.innerHTML='<span class=\"piece\">·</span><span class=\"coord\">('+r+','+c+')</span>';board.appendChild(cell)}}\nfunction chips(id,values){const el=document.getElementById(id);el.innerHTML=values.length?values.map(v=>'<span class=\"chip\">'+v+'</span>').join(''):'<span class=\"empty\">空</span>'}\nfunction render(f,index){document.querySelectorAll('.cell').forEach(el=>{el.className='cell '+((+el.dataset.r + +el.dataset.c)%2?'light':'');el.querySelector('.piece').textContent='·'});f.q.forEach(([r,c])=>{const el=document.querySelector('[data-r=\"'+r+'\"][data-c=\"'+c+'\"]');el.classList.add('queen');el.querySelector('.piece').textContent='Q'});if(f.tryCell){const [r,c]=f.tryCell;const el=document.querySelector('[data-r=\"'+r+'\"][data-c=\"'+c+'\"]');el.classList.add(f.bad?'conflict':'trying');if(!f.bad)el.querySelector('.piece').textContent='Q'}const cols=[...new Set(f.q.map(x=>x[1]))].sort((a,b)=>a-b);const d1=[...new Set(f.q.map(x=>x[0]-x[1]))].sort((a,b)=>a-b);const d2=[...new Set(f.q.map(x=>x[0]+x[1]))].sort((a,b)=>a-b);chips('cols',cols);chips('diag1',d1);chips('diag2',d2);document.getElementById('status').innerHTML='<strong>动作：</strong>'+f.msg;document.getElementById('step').textContent='步骤 '+(index+1)+' / '+frames.length;document.getElementById('bar').style.width=((index+1)/frames.length*100)+'%';document.getElementById('sol1').classList.toggle('active',f.found===1);document.getElementById('sol2').classList.toggle('active',f.found===2)}\nlet current=0;render(frames[current],current);setInterval(()=>{current=(current+1)%frames.length;render(frames[current],current)},1900);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":""}
